# CR 303.7 (Roles): a second Wicked Role Bot1 controls on the same creature puts the first into the graveyard. When that Wicked goes to
# the graveyard (it has a "put into a graveyard" trigger), each opponent loses 1 life: Bot2 goes to 19. Only one Wicked remains and the
# Ornithopter is a 1/3 rather than a 2/4.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Witch's Mark
Witch's Mark
Mountain x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Witch's Mark.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose()
? Bot2.Life = 20
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Witch's Mark.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose()
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 19
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Mox Ruby; Ornithopter; Wicked
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 3
Bot1.Graveyard = Witch's Mark; Witch's Mark
